{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"9bcc884b0e342bd59c26ecf953bcd0a7ce0be56a44a95eee01272b5e756d0dd5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["基督里的新生活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所以，弟兄们，我以 神的慈悲劝你们，将身体献上，当作活祭，是圣洁的，是 神所喜悦的；你们如此事奉乃是理所当然的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要效法这个世界，只要心意更新而变化，叫你们察验何为 神的善良、纯全、可喜悦的旨意。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我凭着所赐我的恩对你们各人说：不要看自己过于所当看的；要照着 神所分给各人信心的大小，看得合乎中道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["正如我们一个身子上有好些肢体，肢体也不都是一样的用处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我们这许多人，在基督里成为一身，互相联络作肢体，也是如此。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["按我们所得的恩赐，各有不同。或说预言，就当照着信心的程度说预言；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["或作执事，就当专一执事；或作教导的，就当专一教导；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["或作劝化的，就当专一劝化；施舍的，就当诚实；治理的，就当殷勤；怜悯人的，就当甘心。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["基督徒的生活守则"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["爱人不可虚假。恶，要厌恶；善，要亲近。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["爱弟兄，要彼此亲热；恭敬人，要彼此推让。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["殷勤，不可懒惰；要心里火热，常常服事主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["在指望中要喜乐；在患难中要忍耐；祷告要恒切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["圣徒缺乏，要帮补；客，要一味地款待。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["逼迫你们的，要给他们祝福；只要祝福，不可咒诅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["与喜乐的人要同乐；与哀哭的人要同哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["要彼此同心；不要志气高大，倒要俯就卑微的人",{"noteId":13},"。不要自以为聪明。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["不要以恶报恶；众人以为美的事要留心去做。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["若是能行，总要尽力与众人和睦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["亲爱的弟兄，不要自己伸冤，宁可让步，听凭主怒",{"noteId":14},"；因为经上记着：「主说：『伸冤在我，我必报应。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["所以，「你的仇敌若饿了，就给他吃，若渴了，就给他喝；因为你这样行就是把炭火堆在他的头上。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["你不可为恶所胜，反要以善胜恶。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":13,"caller":"-","text":"人：或译事","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":16}},{"noteId":14,"caller":"-","text":"或译：让人发怒","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}